  "limits": [
    "Emulator results, not hardware validation. Orchard still records5missedretraces at the close return, down from68; strict keep/combat frame-pacing gates still fail.",
    "All compared native framebuffers match at the existing legal-action/camera/menu checkpoints. Campaign traversal uses supported stage skip; separate combat and castle probes use legal gameplay.",
    "A separate native VSync/GP1 observer records about29.5display flips/s in a short orchard clip but also one-/three-VI alternation and two long holds. Average FPS alone does not establish steady pacing.",
    "The render interval includes GPU completion wait and table clear in both versions. More geometry-cache reserve was measured and rejected rather than used to hide the remaining hitch."
  ],
  "upstream": "Application-only cache eligibility change. Existing local optional Mipsync hooks unchanged; no public PR update."
